(5410914, 777813, 26001, '<td valign="top">stunning colors and perfect focus</td>', 'stunning colors and perfect focus', '2009-04-01 01:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5410927, 777344, 25270, '<td valign="top">nice idea but a little too dark for my taste</td>', 'nice idea but a little too dark for my taste', '2009-04-01 01:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5410936, 777213, 63633, '<td valign="top">Well you''ve certainly cornered the cute vote :)</td>', 'Well you''ve certainly cornered the cute vote :)', '2009-04-01 01:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5410946, 777478, 92545, '<td valign="top">This isn''t my favorite shot in the competition, but I am floored by those blues.  Were those software-enhanced or what?  Love the blue.  The bird got a little blown out it seems, though.</td>', 'This isn''t my favorite shot in the competition, but I am floored by those blues.  Were those software-enhanced or what?  Love the blue.  The bird got a little blown out it seems, though.', '2009-04-01 01:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5410959, 777385, 92545, '<td valign="top">There is a mysterious purple fringe along the horses'' nose that I''m sure others will point out.  Something about this shot just doesn''t seem quite right.  Perhaps this is a pretty severe crop or at the limit of the lenses range?  I think that getting a little closer to the subject might have helped.</td>', 'There is a mysterious purple fringe along the horses'' nose that I''m sure others will point out.  Something about this shot just doesn''t seem quite right.  Perhaps this is a pretty severe crop or at the limit of the lenses range?  I think that getting a little closer to the subject might have helped.', '2009-04-01 01:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5410988, 778411, 92545, '<td valign="top">Very clever shot and title.  It''s not my favorite, but I really like the idea.</td>', 'Very clever shot and title.  It''s not my favorite, but I really like the idea.', '2009-04-01 01:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411000, 778364, 92545, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot, but it either looks like it''s zoomed in too far, too extreme of a crop, or over processed with an unsharp mask.  It just doesn''t quite look natural to me.</td>', 'Incredible shot, but it either looks like it''s zoomed in too far, too extreme of a crop, or over processed with an unsharp mask.  It just doesn''t quite look natural to me.', '2009-04-01 01:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411034, 778290, 92545, '<td valign="top">Clever shot, clever title.</td>', 'Clever shot, clever title.', '2009-04-01 01:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5411046, 778197, 92545, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but it seems a bit over-processed.  I can''t quite put my finger on it, but the greens look over-saturated and the contrast a little high I think.</td>', 'I like the shot, but it seems a bit over-processed.  I can''t quite put my finger on it, but the greens look over-saturated and the contrast a little high I think.', '2009-04-01 01:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
