(5413860, 778576, 104613, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting in this image.  I like the catchlights in the eyes, and wonderful detail in the face.  Not fond of pugs but this one is quite cute!  8.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting in this image.  I like the catchlights in the eyes, and wonderful detail in the face.  Not fond of pugs but this one is quite cute!  8.', '2009-04-01 22:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
