(5413864, 776886, 104613, '<td valign="top">Like the movement in the wings in this image.  Crop is a bit tight though; would have liked to see more room on the left for the duck to ''fly into'' and maybe catch a glimpse of his tail and wingtips too.</td>', 'Like the movement in the wings in this image.  Crop is a bit tight though; would have liked to see more room on the left for the duck to ''fly into'' and maybe catch a glimpse of his tail and wingtips too.', '2009-04-01 23:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413867, 778068, 104613, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF in this one!  Too bad about that distracting dead bud (or whatever it is) in the LRHC.  Really nice colours, good detail in the eye. 8.</td>', 'Nice use of DOF in this one!  Too bad about that distracting dead bud (or whatever it is) in the LRHC.  Really nice colours, good detail in the eye. 8.', '2009-04-01 23:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413869, 776897, 104613, '<td valign="top">Amazing how the title can influence the feel of an image.  Good choice to make it B&amp;W.  Can''t decide if I want to see the rest of the mouth or not, but this works too.</td>', 'Amazing how the title can influence the feel of an image.  Good choice to make it B&W.  Can''t decide if I want to see the rest of the mouth or not, but this works too.', '2009-04-01 23:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413871, 777762, 104613, '<td valign="top">Good lighting in this image.  Nice detail.</td>', 'Good lighting in this image.  Nice detail.', '2009-04-01 23:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413880, 777748, 104613, '<td valign="top">Good focus.  A bit of a blue colour cast on the nose there.</td>', 'Good focus.  A bit of a blue colour cast on the nose there.', '2009-04-01 23:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413887, 776514, 104613, '<td valign="top">Love the blue splash of colour against the neutral background.  Nice focus, and good composition.  Is that rain or snow flying around?  Snow?  Good job on capturing the movement in it in any case.</td>', 'Love the blue splash of colour against the neutral background.  Nice focus, and good composition.  Is that rain or snow flying around?  Snow?  Good job on capturing the movement in it in any case.', '2009-04-01 23:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413904, 778559, 104613, '<td valign="top">Hmm, looks like it''s about to peck you!  Good DOF.  I might have cropped the bottom third out to frame the bird more tightly. 7.</td>', 'Hmm, looks like it''s about to peck you!  Good DOF.  I might have cropped the bottom third out to frame the bird more tightly. 7.', '2009-04-01 23:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5413905, 777175, 104613, '<td valign="top">Nice catchlights in the eyes and good use of DOF. 8,</td>', 'Nice catchlights in the eyes and good use of DOF. 8,', '2009-04-01 23:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
