(5413932, 778341, 104613, '<td valign="top">This is such a cute image.  Really like the composition and the different colours in this one.  Only nit is that the chick''s eye is dark - ie. no catchlight in it to give it that little ''pop''.  Good DOF and detail in the face though.  9.</td>', 'This is such a cute image.  Really like the composition and the different colours in this one.  Only nit is that the chick''s eye is dark - ie. no catchlight in it to give it that little ''pop''.  Good DOF and detail in the face though.  9.', '2009-04-01 23:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
