(5415047, 777717, 62027, '<td valign="top">It''s cool. It would be nice to see how this same content would look if you got down lower. Maybe have a stronger focus on the early budding flowers and get that depth of field of the others coming through (like a force to be reckoned with! a tulip army or something :)<br/> <br/>sorry it got mistakenly submitted, but it deserves critique either way :) Keep it up!</td>', 'It''s cool. It would be nice to see how this same content would look if you got down lower. Maybe have a stronger focus on the early budding flowers and get that depth of field of the others coming through (like a force to be reckoned with! a tulip army or something :) sorry it got mistakenly submitted, but it deserves critique either way :) Keep it up!', '2009-04-02 14:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5415053, 777504, 62027, '<td valign="top">What a great capture! the composition could be better, but what a chance to see the family at home :) Not sure what can be done about the natural lighting, I hesitate to turn the ISO up because it already looks slightly grainy. Look into lighting possibilities (as I am doing too)!</td>', 'What a great capture! the composition could be better, but what a chance to see the family at home :) Not sure what can be done about the natural lighting, I hesitate to turn the ISO up because it already looks slightly grainy. Look into lighting possibilities (as I am doing too)!', '2009-04-02 14:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
