(5415061, 776920, 16106, '<td valign="top">I may be dead off here, but this shot has a strong yellow cast on my monitor, which looks like a color error which I got on a recent submission when I failed to change the image to sRGB before saving for web in Photoshop. If I''m right msg me and ill show you the link that fixed my issue.<br/> <br/>Ohterwise, i like the framing, but the focus is a bit soft. maybe another USM after saving for web?</td>', 'I may be dead off here, but this shot has a strong yellow cast on my monitor, which looks like a color error which I got on a recent submission when I failed to change the image to sRGB before saving for web in Photoshop. If I''m right msg me and ill show you the link that fixed my issue. Ohterwise, i like the framing, but the focus is a bit soft. maybe another USM after saving for web?', '2009-04-02 14:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
