(5415069, 776801, 16106, '<td valign="top">Between the PETA folks and the people who are just sick to death of any pet shots this is gonna score much lower than it ought to. Very sound technically, and while the B&amp;W conversion is well handled, Im not sure it helps the image, unless there was some color issue, if I picture it in color, i think I''d like it better. The kitten''s weary "what now?'' expression cracks me up.</td>', 'Between the PETA folks and the people who are just sick to death of any pet shots this is gonna score much lower than it ought to. Very sound technically, and while the B&W conversion is well handled, Im not sure it helps the image, unless there was some color issue, if I picture it in color, i think I''d like it better. The kitten''s weary "what now?'' expression cracks me up.', '2009-04-02 14:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
