(5417389, 777090, 104643, '<td valign="top">What a sharp contrast with the beautiful coloring of the fox against the perfect white snow.  Great shot!</td>', 'What a sharp contrast with the beautiful coloring of the fox against the perfect white snow.  Great shot!', '2009-04-03 19:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417390, 777027, 104643, '<td valign="top">This is a very sharp photo of something that many of us may not appreciate, but you have made the color contrast eye-catching and appealing and so I really like this. Very creative title.</td>', 'This is a very sharp photo of something that many of us may not appreciate, but you have made the color contrast eye-catching and appealing and so I really like this. Very creative title.', '2009-04-03 19:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417392, 778446, 104643, '<td valign="top">Sharp photo, love the close-up of the eyes.</td>', 'Sharp photo, love the close-up of the eyes.', '2009-04-03 19:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417393, 777404, 104643, '<td valign="top">Creative title and photo.  Nice Job!</td>', 'Creative title and photo.  Nice Job!', '2009-04-03 19:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417394, 777153, 104643, '<td valign="top">It is nice to see a creative shot.  Nice sharp image.</td>', 'It is nice to see a creative shot.  Nice sharp image.', '2009-04-03 19:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417395, 777456, 104643, '<td valign="top">Creative shot, love the coloring and the sharpness.</td>', 'Creative shot, love the coloring and the sharpness.', '2009-04-03 19:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417398, 777309, 104643, '<td valign="top">This bird deserves a great photographer.  Thank you for taking such a sharp photo.</td>', 'This bird deserves a great photographer.  Thank you for taking such a sharp photo.', '2009-04-03 19:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417400, 777755, 104643, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo.</td>', 'Very interesting photo.', '2009-04-03 19:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417401, 778093, 104643, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, great model, creative title.</td>', 'Interesting angle, great model, creative title.', '2009-04-03 19:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417403, 778444, 104643, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo.</td>', 'Very interesting photo.', '2009-04-03 19:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417404, 778191, 104643, '<td valign="top">As a viewer, it is a joy to see your very interesting photo, love the creative angle of the shot and the sharpness.  Of course, it helps to have such a cute model.</td>', 'As a viewer, it is a joy to see your very interesting photo, love the creative angle of the shot and the sharpness.  Of course, it helps to have such a cute model.', '2009-04-03 19:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417407, 778477, 104643, '<td valign="top">Creative title and photo.  Love the coloring and sharpness of this photo. Of course, it helps to have such cute models.</td>', 'Creative title and photo.  Love the coloring and sharpness of this photo. Of course, it helps to have such cute models.', '2009-04-03 19:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417408, 778216, 104643, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo.</td>', 'Very interesting photo.', '2009-04-03 19:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417410, 778380, 104643, '<td valign="top">Sharp photo with a neat model.</td>', 'Sharp photo with a neat model.', '2009-04-03 19:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417412, 778017, 104643, '<td valign="top">Great color contrast! Very interesting photo.</td>', 'Great color contrast! Very interesting photo.', '2009-04-03 19:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417415, 778350, 104643, '<td valign="top">Terrific photo: love the brightness, the creative title, and the coloring.</td>', 'Terrific photo: love the brightness, the creative title, and the coloring.', '2009-04-03 19:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417416, 777891, 104643, '<td valign="top">This photo stood out on the page:cute, original, sharp photo.</td>', 'This photo stood out on the page:cute, original, sharp photo.', '2009-04-03 19:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417417, 777911, 104643, '<td valign="top">Very sharp photo with terrific models...creative title. Just a joy to view.</td>', 'Very sharp photo with terrific models...creative title. Just a joy to view.', '2009-04-03 19:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417586, 777158, 65234, '<td valign="top">Detail and color are excellent.  Wonderful soft catchlights in the eyes.  With such a centered composition and almost symmetrical markings I kind of want the head to be level or very tilted, not have just a slight tilt to it.</td>', 'Detail and color are excellent.  Wonderful soft catchlights in the eyes.  With such a centered composition and almost symmetrical markings I kind of want the head to be level or very tilted, not have just a slight tilt to it.', '2009-04-03 21:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417587, 777984, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the softness here, like he''s emerging from a primordial mist.</td>', 'Like the softness here, like he''s emerging from a primordial mist.', '2009-04-03 21:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417588, 778303, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nailed this one!  Love the diagonal bird and the second bird adds great interest to the background.</td>', 'Nailed this one!  Love the diagonal bird and the second bird adds great interest to the background.', '2009-04-03 21:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417589, 778630, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting shapes to this.</td>', 'Interesting shapes to this.', '2009-04-03 21:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417595, 778371, 65234, '<td valign="top">A little dark but there''s actually pretty nice tonal range here. I like the backlit outline.  Wish this were Advanced editing so you could dodge the catchlight but I do see one, which can be difficult with backlighting.</td>', 'A little dark but there''s actually pretty nice tonal range here. I like the backlit outline.  Wish this were Advanced editing so you could dodge the catchlight but I do see one, which can be difficult with backlighting.', '2009-04-03 21:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417600, 778236, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and bokeh.  These little guys can be hard to catch sitting still ("mine" always seem to be eating or complaining).</td>', 'Nice detail and bokeh.  These little guys can be hard to catch sitting still ("mine" always seem to be eating or complaining).', '2009-04-03 21:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417602, 777027, 65234, '<td valign="top">Depending on what sort of fauna he is that might be a good thing, or not.  Nice composition with the pattern of the bricks in the background.</td>', 'Depending on what sort of fauna he is that might be a good thing, or not.  Nice composition with the pattern of the bricks in the background.', '2009-04-03 21:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417603, 777941, 65234, '<td valign="top">Osprey!  Looking rather windblown in that impressively large nest.  Nice detail, especially on the eye.  I might have cropped out the supporting log/tree.</td>', 'Osprey!  Looking rather windblown in that impressively large nest.  Nice detail, especially on the eye.  I might have cropped out the supporting log/tree.', '2009-04-03 21:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417604, 777740, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty, and a lovely light blue to set him(?) off.</td>', 'Pretty, and a lovely light blue to set him(?) off.', '2009-04-03 21:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417605, 777489, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely bird!  Pretty green background to set him off, and I love that he''s looking right at me.</td>', 'Lovely bird!  Pretty green background to set him off, and I love that he''s looking right at me.', '2009-04-03 21:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417607, 778054, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice light on them.</td>', 'Nice light on them.', '2009-04-03 21:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417611, 777901, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and detail.  Color looks just a little washed-out on my screen; I''d deepen it with a curves adjusment.</td>', 'Nice composition and detail.  Color looks just a little washed-out on my screen; I''d deepen it with a curves adjusment.', '2009-04-03 21:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417613, 777903, 65234, '<td valign="top">I have one of these guys hanging out in my neighborhood, but I can''t imagine getting such a detailed portrait unless I got a much longer lens!  Wonderful detail, in the eyes, especially.</td>', 'I have one of these guys hanging out in my neighborhood, but I can''t imagine getting such a detailed portrait unless I got a much longer lens!  Wonderful detail, in the eyes, especially.', '2009-04-03 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417614, 777634, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute juxtaposition.</td>', 'Cute juxtaposition.', '2009-04-03 21:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417617, 776836, 65234, '<td valign="top">Did you teach the cat to yawn or are you just very, very patient?  Light is a bit harsh, like a flash was used without a diffuser.</td>', 'Did you teach the cat to yawn or are you just very, very patient?  Light is a bit harsh, like a flash was used without a diffuser.', '2009-04-03 21:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417620, 777692, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute little guy.  Nice diagonal on the composition; I''d crop tighter on top and get rid of some of the cage.</td>', 'Cute little guy.  Nice diagonal on the composition; I''d crop tighter on top and get rid of some of the cage.', '2009-04-03 21:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417621, 777891, 65234, '<td valign="top">Sweet little face :-)  Light is a bit harsh.</td>', 'Sweet little face :-)  Light is a bit harsh.', '2009-04-03 21:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417623, 778191, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  He looks pensive.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  He looks pensive.', '2009-04-03 21:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417625, 777863, 65234, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like the poor bird was sudsed!  Fun capture.</td>', 'Almost looks like the poor bird was sudsed!  Fun capture.', '2009-04-03 21:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417626, 778570, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice setting for him.</td>', 'Looks like a nice setting for him.', '2009-04-03 21:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417629, 777832, 65234, '<td valign="top">Two at once is pretty impressive!  Looks like he''s taking aim =:-O</td>', 'Two at once is pretty impressive!  Looks like he''s taking aim =:-O', '2009-04-03 21:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417632, 777685, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very ... weathered.  Not the prettiest face I''ve ever seen, bt I''ll try not to be a speciesist.</td>', 'Very ... weathered.  Not the prettiest face I''ve ever seen, bt I''ll try not to be a speciesist.', '2009-04-03 21:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417634, 778225, 65234, '<td valign="top">Those ears are simply adorable!  Image looks a little too bright on my monitor.</td>', 'Those ears are simply adorable!  Image looks a little too bright on my monitor.', '2009-04-03 21:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417641, 777093, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cool bird!  Quite fancy-looking.  White balance seems a little off (kind of yellow).</td>', 'Very cool bird!  Quite fancy-looking.  White balance seems a little off (kind of yellow).', '2009-04-03 22:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417643, 777145, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a metallic statue.</td>', 'Looks like a metallic statue.', '2009-04-03 22:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417645, 778195, 65234, '<td valign="top">He certainly does look sly with those narrowed eyes.  Really nice detail.</td>', 'He certainly does look sly with those narrowed eyes.  Really nice detail.', '2009-04-03 22:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417646, 778341, 65234, '<td valign="top">Poor little chick!</td>', 'Poor little chick!', '2009-04-03 22:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417647, 778068, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Very cute capture.</td>', 'LOL!  Very cute capture.', '2009-04-03 22:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417649, 778416, 65234, '<td valign="top">That seed looks much too big for that Chickadee!  I''d do a bit of a curves adjustment to bring out the detail on the head.</td>', 'That seed looks much too big for that Chickadee!  I''d do a bit of a curves adjustment to bring out the detail on the head.', '2009-04-03 22:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417650, 777593, 65234, '<td valign="top">They do look gorgeous in the snow.  I might have gone for a closer, less centered crop.</td>', 'They do look gorgeous in the snow.  I might have gone for a closer, less centered crop.', '2009-04-03 22:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417651, 778232, 65234, '<td valign="top">Well captured, if not exactly attractive.  Like the diagonal of his pose.</td>', 'Well captured, if not exactly attractive.  Like the diagonal of his pose.', '2009-04-03 22:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5417652, 778510, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great DOF to bring him out of his hiding place.  Geez, even his eyes are camouflaged!</td>', 'Great DOF to bring him out of his hiding place.  Geez, even his eyes are camouflaged!', '2009-04-03 22:08:11.000000', NULL, 1);
