(5419046, 777940, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a House Finch (male).  Cute little guy; feeder looks quite rustic.</td>', 'Looks like a House Finch (male).  Cute little guy; feeder looks quite rustic.', '2009-04-04 22:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
