(5419524, 778244, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on his scaly skin.  Focus seems to be sharpest on his shoulder where I would prefer it on his eye.  I''d also crop out the wood as I don''t think it adds anything interesting to the composition.</td>', 'Nice detail on his scaly skin.  Focus seems to be sharpest on his shoulder where I would prefer it on his eye.  I''d also crop out the wood as I don''t think it adds anything interesting to the composition.', '2009-04-05 11:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
