(5424253, 777385, 101668, '<td valign="top">Animals suffer more during winter than humans and that is why they don''t make good subjects this time of year. The scragginess of the horse doesn''t help the picture overall.</td>', 'Animals suffer more during winter than humans and that is why they don''t make good subjects this time of year. The scragginess of the horse doesn''t help the picture overall.', '2009-04-07 16:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424257, 778017, 101668, '<td valign="top">Maybe this horse is either used to the cold winters or he stays inside. It doesn''t seem that he just came out of winter. One of the better "horse" pictures.</td>', 'Maybe this horse is either used to the cold winters or he stays inside. It doesn''t seem that he just came out of winter. One of the better "horse" pictures.', '2009-04-07 17:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424270, 778405, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute little bird and nice composition.</td>', 'Cute little bird and nice composition.', '2009-04-07 17:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424275, 777385, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective with the fence blocking Ginger and also blocking us from seeing anything more to the left.  The viewer is sort of in there with her.  She looks a tad too yellow for me; I''d shift the yellow-orange hues redder.</td>', 'Interesting perspective with the fence blocking Ginger and also blocking us from seeing anything more to the left.  The viewer is sort of in there with her.  She looks a tad too yellow for me; I''d shift the yellow-orange hues redder.', '2009-04-07 17:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424279, 777912, 65234, '<td valign="top">Polka dots are really obvious from this perspective.  For some reason I''ve never looked at a Flicker from directly below.  Colors are a little washed out; I''d suggest a levels or curves adjustment to deepen them.</td>', 'Polka dots are really obvious from this perspective.  For some reason I''ve never looked at a Flicker from directly below.  Colors are a little washed out; I''d suggest a levels or curves adjustment to deepen them.', '2009-04-07 17:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424282, 777975, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  He looks to be fat and happy ;-)  I''d klike a touch more DOF so the back of his head is in focus, too.</td>', 'Nice colors.  He looks to be fat and happy ;-)  I''d klike a touch more DOF so the back of his head is in focus, too.', '2009-04-07 17:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424284, 778657, 65234, '<td valign="top">Reflections upon reflections!  The poor dog looks overwhelmed.  Clever shot.</td>', 'Reflections upon reflections!  The poor dog looks overwhelmed.  Clever shot.', '2009-04-07 17:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424285, 778431, 65234, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like the head and rear belong to two different animals.</td>', 'Almost looks like the head and rear belong to two different animals.', '2009-04-07 17:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424288, 777400, 65234, '<td valign="top">With a notch missing from one ear, I see.  Poor little one has had a rough life.  Nice capture of those big, alert eyes and the body poised to run.</td>', 'With a notch missing from one ear, I see.  Poor little one has had a rough life.  Nice capture of those big, alert eyes and the body poised to run.', '2009-04-07 17:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424290, 777309, 65234, '<td valign="top">When my parrot eyes me that way I try to be out of biting distance ;-)  The green background is nicely complementary.  I suspect some will find the DOF too shallow but it''s working for me with that particular facial expression.</td>', 'When my parrot eyes me that way I try to be out of biting distance ;-)  The green background is nicely complementary.  I suspect some will find the DOF too shallow but it''s working for me with that particular facial expression.', '2009-04-07 17:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
