(5424301, 777811, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s saying, "Bring it on!"  Tough capture, as these guys don''t seem to stay put for long.  Looks like a little too much noise reduction in the middles and too much sharpening on the edges.</td>', 'Looks like he''s saying, "Bring it on!"  Tough capture, as these guys don''t seem to stay put for long.  Looks like a little too much noise reduction in the middles and too much sharpening on the edges.', '2009-04-07 17:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
