(5424314, 778451, 65234, '<td valign="top">Egads; it is!  I try not to get quite that far into a snake''s personal space ;-)  <br/> <br/>Awful lot of stuff reflected in that eye (looks like a hand or two and sky and a tree ...).  Might have liked to see more of the eye and less reflected in it if that were possible.  Nice detail on the scales.  Very nice.</td>', 'Egads; it is!  I try not to get quite that far into a snake''s personal space ;-)   Awful lot of stuff reflected in that eye (looks like a hand or two and sky and a tree ...).  Might have liked to see more of the eye and less reflected in it if that were possible.  Nice detail on the scales.  Very nice.', '2009-04-07 17:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424318, 776749, 65234, '<td valign="top">They coulkd be mistaken for goslings if it weren''t for those long legs!  Really tough exposure with one adult in sun and one in shadow.  Might have been better to have them all in a similar lighting but I know wildlife doesn''t always give you choices.</td>', 'They coulkd be mistaken for goslings if it weren''t for those long legs!  Really tough exposure with one adult in sun and one in shadow.  Might have been better to have them all in a similar lighting but I know wildlife doesn''t always give you choices.', '2009-04-07 17:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424322, 778283, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute little bird!  The top of his head makes him look like a self-important little fellow ;-)</td>', 'Cute little bird!  The top of his head makes him look like a self-important little fellow ;-)', '2009-04-07 17:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424323, 778273, 65234, '<td valign="top">And getting along very nicely.  Makes me want to go take a nap!</td>', 'And getting along very nicely.  Makes me want to go take a nap!', '2009-04-07 17:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424329, 778446, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ordinarily I would want the beak in focus, too, but this just comes across as funny, like the bird was trying to make me laugh (and there is that old song about a Kookaburra laughing so maybe that predisposed me to respond with a smile).</td>', 'Ordinarily I would want the beak in focus, too, but this just comes across as funny, like the bird was trying to make me laugh (and there is that old song about a Kookaburra laughing so maybe that predisposed me to respond with a smile).', '2009-04-07 17:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424332, 778508, 65234, '<td valign="top">They look to be enjoying themselves :-)  Pretty horses.</td>', 'They look to be enjoying themselves :-)  Pretty horses.', '2009-04-07 17:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424335, 776847, 65234, '<td valign="top">Easier to play dead with closed eyes, I think.  Nice camouflage colors.  I like the diagonal of the composition.</td>', 'Easier to play dead with closed eyes, I think.  Nice camouflage colors.  I like the diagonal of the composition.', '2009-04-07 17:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5424337, 777813, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice work to get that orange in the background to point to and envelop the bug.  Sets him off well.</td>', 'Nice work to get that orange in the background to point to and envelop the bug.  Sets him off well.', '2009-04-07 17:51:43.000000', NULL, 1);
