(5424376, 776514, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty, pretty bird.  Clearly not the type to use camouflage for protection ;-)  I''d crop even tighter on him, especially on the bottom.</td>', 'Pretty, pretty bird.  Clearly not the type to use camouflage for protection ;-)  I''d crop even tighter on him, especially on the bottom.', '2009-04-07 18:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
