(5424437, 778303, 77192, '<td valign="top">That''s a belter of a shot. I''ve taken this sort of shot many many times and I don''t think I''ve ever pulled it off nearly as well as you have here. Well done.</td>', 'That''s a belter of a shot. I''ve taken this sort of shot many many times and I don''t think I''ve ever pulled it off nearly as well as you have here. Well done.', '2009-04-07 18:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
