(5425822, 776801, 23002, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot Agnes!  You got me on this one.  For some reason the trolls did not like mine and gave it 11 votes of 1!  It looks like your shot suffered from some of those nasty "cat haters".  I really do not understand this place!  All the low voting trolls (you have 11 that are 3 and under) and no comments because they are gutless cowards.<br/> <br/>With all the strange voting patterns in this challenge I really, really hope the SC is investigating</td>', 'Lovely shot Agnes!  You got me on this one.  For some reason the trolls did not like mine and gave it 11 votes of 1!  It looks like your shot suffered from some of those nasty "cat haters".  I really do not understand this place!  All the low voting trolls (you have 11 that are 3 and under) and no comments because they are gutless cowards. With all the strange voting patterns in this challenge I really, really hope the SC is investigating', '2009-04-08 07:04:42.000000', NULL, 0),
