(5433285, 778034, 67145, '<td valign="top">such a brilliant image .. its so grungy with the fur, the contrasts and your processing &amp; i love the way they''re all squeezed up so close .. <br/>its normal for brilliant photographs to get a few low scores but if this was entered when the olympics were going on then that would explain the 11 1''s .. i''ve noticed that at that time heaps of amazing images, like this one, get way more low scores than they would ordinarily ..<br/>pretty sad really .. :)</td>', 'such a brilliant image .. its so grungy with the fur, the contrasts and your processing & i love the way they''re all squeezed up so close .. its normal for brilliant photographs to get a few low scores but if this was entered when the olympics were going on then that would explain the 11 1''s .. i''ve noticed that at that time heaps of amazing images, like this one, get way more low scores than they would ordinarily ..pretty sad really .. :)', '2009-04-12 18:15:58.000000', NULL, 0),
