(5578473, 777301, 47906, '<td valign="top">I love the color of the peacock you have captured, and also like the texture and detaul in the feathers. I think that this has a minimalistic feel to it the way the you shot this, the body of the peacock vs the huge amounts of its feathers makes me feel this way. I love how all the spots on the peacocks feathers create such nice lines in themselves if you play connect the dots with you eyes. Just lovely.</td>', 'I love the color of the peacock you have captured, and also like the texture and detaul in the feathers. I think that this has a minimalistic feel to it the way the you shot this, the body of the peacock vs the huge amounts of its feathers makes me feel this way. I love how all the spots on the peacocks feathers create such nice lines in themselves if you play connect the dots with you eyes. Just lovely.', '2009-07-18 13:40:05.000000', NULL, 0),
